# The build context is the repository root (workload/Dockerfile,
# workload/tee/Dockerfile.tee). Only the workload tree and the two lock
# files are read; everything else stays out of the context and out of the
# image. The reader's tests and their fixtures stay out too: the stage
# builds cmd/stream-reader alone.
*
!workload/
!analysis.lock
!camlink.lock
workload/tests/
workload/reader/**/*_test.go
workload/reader/testmedia/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
